Hello visitors, my name is **Hải Hà** (my friends call me Haiko, thus the name of this site).

I am a Web Developer, Photographer & Vlogger currently living in 🇨🇿 Prague, Czech Republic. This city is a gorgeous medieval marvel, an Architectural paradise, an inspiration to many romantic movies, and it is also the place where I grew up and spent my whole life ☺️. Currently I am focusing in the JavaScript ecosystem, which is React, React Native & NodeJS. As for the Framework, I really like the promising NextJS.

I am originally from Vietnam 🇻🇳, the country that many know through American movies, usually associated with War ⚔️, but nowadays it is one of the coolest countries to visit in South East Asia, thanks to the beautiful countryside and delicious food. And YES, the famous "PHO" 🍜 soup! In fact, it is so beautiful that many movies were shot here. The latest film name is "Kong: Skull Island", so if you have not seen it yet, please check it out — it's quite a good movie, plus you will see the gorgeous landscape!

